      "email": "sharmarke.aden@gmail.com",
      "message": "added support for junit5\n\n- made the value of @Name annotation optional, it defaults to \"\" \n- added collaborator provider provided instances to the DefaultServiceInstance\n- refactored the location of parameter resolvers\n- added the ability to resolve @Real and @Name parameters\n- added more test cases\n- fixed @SystemTest annotation (missing SystemTestExtension)"
    },
